  "status": "published",
  "description_html": "<h5 class=\"intro\">Dance under the stars!</h5>\nRomantic is a perfect venue for small weddings in France. With high spec accommodation, private facilities, courtyard, barn and even its own church!  So, Romantic ticks all the boxes. Set in the glorious Lot countryside this gem houses up to 25 and features an exterior dancing area for those hoping to spend the night dancing under the stars.\n\nMid-week two-night weddings at Romantic, include (for Perfect Little Wedding events) lots for free! Such as: breakfast on your wedding day for you and your on-site guests; outdoor dance floor and outdoor lighting; a keg of beer; and the outdoor music system.  What more could you ask for from a venue for small weddings in France?  All you have to do is get the party started!\n\nhttps://vimeo.com/198706139",
  "guide_price_html": "<h6 style=\"text-align: left\">Included in the Guide Price</h6>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Two nights’ hire of The Romantic Château</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>A breakfast on your wedding day for you and your on-site guests</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Our expert Event Management team</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Your four-course Wedding Meal</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Your Waiting Staff for your wedding day</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Wine and drinks for your wedding day</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>An outdoor dance floor and lighting</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>A keg of draught beer</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Hire of plates, glasses and cutlery for your wedding meal</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Wedding cake</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Music equipment hire</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Flowers</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Photographer</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Celebrant</em></p>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Low season: April and October</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Mid-season: May</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">High season: June and September</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Peak season: July and August</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">This venue offers you 2 or 3 nights mid-week</p>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">The guide price starts from just €13,500 for a wedding in low season; to just €17,775 in peak season.  This is based on contributions of as little as €60 per night from twenty-two of your guests for their accommodation, (which is normal practice at destination weddings).</p>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Please <a href=\"https://www.perfectlittlewedding.com/contact/\">get in touch</a> if you would like our detailed guide prices including third night options and other seasons – or if you have any other questions!</p>\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align: left\">Nearest Airports</h6>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Bergerac (30mins) Bordeaux (1hr 55mins) Toulouse (2hrs)</p>\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align: left\">Nearest Train</h6>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Tonneins (35mins)</p>\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align: left\">Wedding facilities</h6>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Chapel on site</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Barn for dining</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Courtyard</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Outside dancing</p>\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align: left\">Accommodation</h6>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">25 people</p>\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align: left\">Maximum 30 people on your wedding day</h6>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Including those staying at the venue</p>",
